@startuml proposed-as-is-system-architecture
!theme plain
left to right direction
skinparam componentStyle uml2
skinparam linetype ortho
skinparam defaultFontName Arial
skinparam defaultFontSize 11

title SCENTSTATION - AS-IS SYSTEM ARCHITECTURE (PROPOSED REVIEW)

actor "Public clients\nWeb / Kiosk / Payment Provider" as Client

package "Edge" {
  component "API Gateway\n:8080" as Gateway
  component "GatewayTrustBoundaryFilter" as Trust
  Gateway -[hidden]-> Trust
}

package "Business services" {
  component "Identity Service\n:8081" as Identity
  component "Catalog Service\n:8082" as Catalog
  component "Order Service\n:8083" as Order
  component "Machine Service\n:8084" as Machine
  component "Operation Service\n:8085" as Operation
  component "Reporting Service\n:8086" as Reporting
}

package "Database per service - MySQL 8.4" {
  database "scentstation_identity" as IdentityDB
  database "scentstation_catalog" as CatalogDB
  database "order_db" as OrderDB
  database "scentstation_machine" as MachineDB
  database "scentstation_operation" as OperationDB
  database "scentstation_reporting" as ReportingDB
}

component "Device / MQTT / Serial adapter\n<<not implemented>>" as DeviceAdapter #F8CECC
component "Operation MachineSlotClient\n<<local/test/docker-local stub>>" as SlotStub #FFF2CC
component "Catalog MachineAvailabilityClient\n<<local/test stub>>" as AvailabilityStub #FFF2CC

Client --> Gateway : HTTP
Gateway --> Trust : sanitize headers / block internal path
Trust --> Identity : identity route prefixes
Trust --> Catalog : catalog route prefixes
Trust --> Order : /api/v1/orders/**\n/api/v1/payments/**
Trust --> Machine : machine route prefixes
Trust --> Operation : /api/inventory/**\n/api/maintenance/**
Trust --> Reporting : /api/reporting/**

Identity -- IdentityDB
Catalog -- CatalogDB
Order -- OrderDB
Machine -- MachineDB
Operation -- OperationDB
Reporting -- ReportingDB

Catalog ..> Identity : POST /internal/auth/introspect
Order ..> Identity : POST /internal/auth/introspect
Machine ..> Identity : POST /internal/auth/introspect
Operation ..> Identity : POST /internal/auth/introspect
Reporting ..> Identity : POST /internal/auth/introspect

Order ..> Machine : GET /internal/machines/{machineId}/slots/{slotId}\nPOST /api/machines/dispense-commands
Order ..> Catalog : GET /internal/catalog/order-products/{productId}
Order ..> Reporting : POST /api/reporting/internal/transactions/sync

Reporting ..> Order : GET /api/v1/payments/{reference}
Reporting ..> Machine : list machines / locations / alerts
Reporting ..> Operation : list batches / bottles / movements / tickets

Operation ..> SlotStub : getSlot() only
Catalog ..> AvailabilityStub : getProductAvailability()
Machine ..> Operation : optional configured alert handoff\n/api/maintenance/alerts/critical
Machine ..> DeviceAdapter : missing ACK/result transport

legend right
  |= Connector |= Meaning |
  | solid | public routing / data ownership |
  | dotted | synchronous service integration |
  | yellow | implemented stub, not production HTTP adapter |
  | red | required adapter is not implemented |
endlegend

@enduml
